      },
      "text": "Then acute sorrell , and sweet three-leav'd grasse, And for 2 sawce he seldome is at charges, For every crab-tree doth afoord him vergls His banket sometImee is greene beanes and peason , Nuts, peares, plumbes, apples, as they are in season .",
