        "y0": 0.7189655172413794,
        "x1": 0.952112676056338,
        "y1": 0.7586206896551724
      },
      "text": "Long lay the kyng,there away wolde not hee Dayly he propherld batayle : the enmys durst not fyghte Lacke of logynge and vltayle It was grett peté,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
